{"parse": {"title": "以骑士之名-07", "pageid": 127817, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BB%A5%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8D-06\" title=\"以骑士之名-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">以骑士之名-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BB%A5%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8D-08\" title=\"以骑士之名-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">以骑士之名</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.B1.B1.E9.B9.B0.E4.B8.8E.E6.9F.B4\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"山鹰与柴\">山鹰与柴</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 山鹰与柴</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Eagle and the Firewood</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312743.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-312743.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312743.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312743.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-312743.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312743.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-312743.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312743.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>驾——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312743.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-312743.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312743.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312743.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-312743.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312743.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-312743.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312743.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>跑快些，芙蕾雅！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>萨克森马抬高了蹄子，一头扎进阿尔卑斯山迅猛的山谷风中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>头顶之上，山鹰翱翔，健壮的翅膀切割天际，画出一道鎏金的尾迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312740.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-312740.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312740.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312740.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-312740.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312740.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-312740.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312740.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>看啊，维拉娜痊愈之后能飞得这么高……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱仰望着高飞的猛禽，一种青涩的激情将她的面庞染得金光闪闪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个月前，她在岩壁下发现了这只奄奄一息的山鹰。此后，她精心照料。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>终于，在她十八岁的这一天，山鹰痊愈，毫无留恋地飞向天穹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>也是在这一天，玛尔纱身着骑士礼服，在接纳礼上郑重宣誓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312740.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-312740.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312740.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312740.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-312740.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312740.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-312740.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312740.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>芙蕾雅，我马上也要上战场了，我向团长递交了飞行员申请——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_06.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_06\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_06\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Cg-3_3_bg_06.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_06.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Cg-3_3_bg_06.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_06.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Cg-3_3_bg_06.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_06.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她在颠簸中俯身，对马儿分享隐秘的理想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312740.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-312740.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312740.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312740.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-312740.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312740.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-312740.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312740.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我也要像维拉娜一样，高高地在天空飞翔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312741.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-312741.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312741.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312741.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-312741.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312741.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-312741.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312741.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>你知道吗？成为飞行员的骑士在信里说，在天上，地上的万物都渺小得像石头上的苔藓！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>十八岁的玛尔纱在正式成为骑士，即将赶往战场之际，策马追逐山鹰的翱翔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她感受风掠过耳边的喧嚣，如同她已在血和火之间，即将迎接荣誉疾驰而来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312741.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-312741.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312741.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312741.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-312741.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312741.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-312741.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312741.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>在空中，人们凭借技巧和勇气，堂堂正正地分出胜负，就像过去骑士的长枪比武。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312741.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-312741.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312741.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312741.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-312741.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312741.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-312741.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312741.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>以一己之力为自己的国家挣得公正的胜利！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她畅快展望。恍惚间，她又成了那只越飞越远的山鹰，像它一样俯视启航的土地，继而冲向云层。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>天与地之间的距离就此消弭，理想于是也触手可及。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312740.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-312740.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312740.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312740.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-312740.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312740.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-312740.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312740.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>再快些吧，芙蕾雅！别让维拉娜丢下我们——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马儿高声嘶鸣。它在骑士激越的胸怀间自由驰骋，如同一道闪电，原野由此不再广袤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>荣耀、勇敢、忠诚，骑士的冠名词。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>于马背上尽情追逐时，玛尔纱相信自己的存在会系于这些词语昭示的归属之上。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最终，飞鹰彻底化作天际线上一枚灰点。她不得不停下，目送理想乘着鹰的翅膀远行，直到——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>终于找到你了，玛尔纱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱回过神，从马背上跳下，难掩激动地跑至恩师身前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312740.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-312740.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312740.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312740.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-312740.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312740.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-312740.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312740.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>阿德海德！我的调令来了，对吗？团长同意我的申请了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德叹了口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>玛尔纱，你被分配至第15步兵团，一周后出发。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德重重握住玛尔纱的肩膀，严肃的神情试图冷却玛尔纱此刻的激情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>真正的战场容不下天真的妄想，玛尔纱，你要保重，照顾好自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那时的玛尔纱尚未理解这份郑重的嘱托究竟意味着什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>尽管现实与理想之间出现了偏差，但她仍是迫不及待。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——她也将征战，追寻骑士的荣光！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_chucangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_chucangjian\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_chucangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-2_7_bg_chucangjian.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_chucangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-2_7_bg_chucangjian.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_chucangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-2_7_bg_chucangjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_chucangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱被骨缝间的酸胀唤醒，耳边还残余着鼓噪的心跳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冰水成功为她安抚了神秘术反噬带来的剧痛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她被安置于用被单和干草临时铺就的“床铺”之上，身上的衣物也已干透了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>得好好谢谢阿德海德……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她缓慢地坐起，一双手映入眼帘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>指甲挫伤，骨茧凸起，双手的皮肤也已干燥开裂，指缝间残留着红褐色印记。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是一双由骑士训练锤炼的手，也是一双由消毒水、碘酒重新塑造的手。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou\"><img alt=\"guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png/600px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png/900px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伤员：</div><div>呃——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>谁去看看伊利亚，他的伤口也许感染了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱走出储藏间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我这儿有达金氏液！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>二十四岁的玛尔纱从一座偏僻小城的野战医院中醒来，梦逝去得远了，激情也消散了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>唯有骑士给予她的责任，仍然不能作伪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我来为伊利亚清创。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她回到病人之间，将过往留在身后。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zhongshijijiedao_ye\"><img alt=\"zhongshijijiedao_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png/600px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png/900px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png/1200px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>星与月再次悬织在黑色的绸缎上。医院的修整工作由此告一段落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>……长官，如果可以，希望基金会能为重伤员后续的安全转移提供保障。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523721.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523721.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>这件事交由“剃刀”安排，稍后我会通知他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>“剃刀”先生本应在今天傍晚和我在镇上会合，但我一直没能与他取得联系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523721.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523721.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>他在路上遭遇了重塑之手。现在已经解决了，不久后就能抵达医院。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱稍微放下心来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>原来是这样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>另外，医院里还有不少轻伤员，他们都是来自顿河的士兵，伤势好转后想要回到家乡剿匪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我申请在他们恢复行动力之前，继续在这儿提供援助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523721.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523721.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>可以。既然他们之后会返乡，我希望你能一同前去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523721.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523721.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>司辰不久之后也会启程前往顿河。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523721.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523721.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>支援顿河骑兵队，与司辰小队汇合并协助她。这是你接下来的任务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我明白了，长官。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523721.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523721.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>骑士团的情况呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我已查明骑士滞留的缘由，目前正在与骑士团成员展开合作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523721.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523721.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>好，希望骑士团对基金会的态度也能因此改善。及时汇报后续进展。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>是，长官。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希尔德加德：</div><div>玛尔纱！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>结束了联络通讯，玛尔纱遥遥听见一声呼唤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不远处，骑士们零星围坐在一起，间或传来稀疏的笑声。希尔德加德向她招了招手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希尔德加德：</div><div>你好些了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>嗯，我已经恢复了，让你们担心了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>希尔德加德摆了摆手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希尔德加德：</div><div>幸亏阿德海德发现得早，不然你可能真的会陷入危险。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱在希尔德加德身旁坐下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>你们刚才在聊什么呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希尔德加德：</div><div>一些以前的事，刚好聊到小时候在修道院因为劳作太辛苦而哭鼻子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>夜色在骑士们的面庞上落下影影绰绰的怀念。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>噢，我记得，那时候要搬回去的柴，直立起来和小孩儿一般高。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希尔德加德：</div><div>是啊，有些坏家伙总是喜欢使唤我们去做。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>城堡里并非每个人都有正直的品行，总有一些侍从想要偷懒，于是孩童便不得不劳碌起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希尔德加德：</div><div>以前，我们总是一起抬着木柴回去，路上还要手忙脚乱地捡起那些掉出来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希尔德加德：</div><div>有些骨碌碌地跑得太远了，滚到山脚下，来不及追。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>幼时的玛尔纱与希尔德加德便只能坐在山坡上的岩石旁，疲惫地叹息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>但我很喜欢那时候你为它们编织的故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>你说，这些木料离开了养育自己的根脉，从人们手上巧妙地溜走，它们会走向山下，开始自己的冒险。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>它们会与风交涉，与尘沙、草木搏斗，在河流间沉浮，最后它们停泊在岸边，等待新的旅途。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希尔德加德：</div><div>哈哈，一个经典的“骑士”寓言！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在场的骑士们默契地笑了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>枝丫在他们身后手拉着手，将骑士的往事悬挂在医院的屋檐下。风吹起它，往事如湿透的床单淅淅沥沥落下了水。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希尔德加德：</div><div>玛尔纱，我真怀念那时候呀，再琐碎的事都有不必质疑的意义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希尔德加德：</div><div>日子不会改变，一切井然有序。就算是一捆柴，也注定能在燃烧中光亮一间小小的暗室。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>万事万物的一生都得到了框定，它们启程，搏斗，辗转，但也将满载而归。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是她们的故事，也是世间万物的故事。她们想象不出，也不必想象其他故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>……你也同阿德海德聊过了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希尔德加德：</div><div>嗯，我们所有人都想知道，离开这座医院后该做些什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希尔德加德：</div><div>玛尔纱，你已经找到了你的路，是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>童年伙伴注视着玛尔纱，眼中带着些许羡慕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>你知道吗，希尔达？遇上阿德海德后，我也开始梦到以前的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱摊开手，像是展开书页一般，将虚空一页页翻过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>梦境让我审视过往，接着让我在当下醒来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>于是我能肯定，我行了远路，却并未走上歧路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>骑士们也会迎来这一天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>话毕，玛尔纱望向四周。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>希尔达，阿德海德在哪儿？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "以骑士之名-07"}}